    {
      "id": 296183,
      "name": "Barren Landscape",
      "note": "<p>On many of the <strong>central islands</strong> you can find a very</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>barren landscape</strong></li>\n<li><strong>small bushes</strong></li>\n<li><strong>no trees in sight</strong>\nThis tends to be more common on the smaller islands with coverage.</li>\n</ul>",
