    },
    {
      "id": 296201,
      "name": "French Bollards",
      "note": "<p>A road from <strong>Kilkis</strong> to <strong>Kerkini Lake National Park</strong> (north of Thessaloniki) features <strong>French-style bollards</strong>, which are unique in Greece. Look at the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/edit?mid=15ue2ecn8Mox-G6TK3u3SZsJ2GoNglnM&#x26;usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">map</a> for exact locs.</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1279/GUWInjPh70cO3w8NWeJsycDiz9HHj5eD72FE.avif"
