      "id": 296203,
      "name": "Pinus Nigra",
      "note": "<p>While the map shows <strong>several hotspots</strong>, the main areas with Pinus Nigra forests are at the <strong>northern end</strong> of the <strong>Pindus Mountains</strong>. The spots in the <strong>Peloponnese</strong> are also notable.</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1278/9EBhd3OF1oGKZU8Iujp5af4zKaAaf5cT0qq7.avif",
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1278/XPtIj1EPfDZrE5UgcGyXgMHwQy74MJP8FmKI.avif"
      ],
      "locationsCount": 4,
      "footer": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zmdDA3a4tkoAzshgASNzvThVyXFGAC9Rnpcjn_vUr34/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Greece doc</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": 296196,
      "name": "Pistacchio Plantations",
      "note": "<p>The island of Egina is full of pistacchio plantations, which are relatively unique to the island.</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1279/4NxbqyP0rgo8FgFGq6KFSrJMcCcBwE5BJUwH.avif"
      ],
      "locationsCount": 5,
      "footer": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zmdDA3a4tkoAzshgASNzvThVyXFGAC9Rnpcjn_vUr34/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Greece doc</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": 334294,
      "name": "Rice",
      "note": "<p>Rice can only be seen in these two areas</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1279/Xx3c4Br2JgaMpOQXLdckN4lLSGjhdj5UxVB0.avif"
      ],
      "locationsCount": 5,
      "footer": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zmdDA3a4tkoAzshgASNzvThVyXFGAC9Rnpcjn_vUr34/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Greece doc</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": 364468,
      "name": "Russian Signs",
      "note": "<p><strong>Heraklion</strong> is a popular holiday spot for Russians, and it is not uncommon to find signs written in <strong>Russian</strong> in the more <strong>touristic parts</strong>.</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1279/QJsmNzKZlHuitzv1oIrSi9EoxWyc1IkJBudn.avif"
      ],
      "locationsCount": 1,
      "footer": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zmdDA3a4tkoAzshgASNzvThVyXFGAC9Rnpcjn_vUr34/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Greece doc</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": 334291,
      "name": "Santorini Architecture",
      "note": "<p>Santorini architecture is very distinct. Like cyclade architecture more generally, it is very whitewashed, however it is distinct for its curved roofs and semi-circle <strong>windows/porticoes</strong>.</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1279/ynR4kfRRPEW2uNj0HjRGAq5zcUMyABccLNNS.avif"
      ],
      "locationsCount": 5,
      "footer": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zmdDA3a4tkoAzshgASNzvThVyXFGAC9Rnpcjn_vUr34/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Greece doc</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": 359483,
      "name": "Slate Slabs",
      "note": "<p>Some houses on <strong>Ikaria</strong> have these distinct roofs made of large slate slabs.</p>",
      "images": [
        "https://learnablemeta.com/images/1279/wTlOHtsLM9qLX9z9oEwijdYoKzjY17ck83nb.avif"
