    },
    {
      "id": 296180,
      "name": "Tall Mountains",
      "note": "<p>The <strong>tallest Greek mountains</strong> are found in the <strong>western half</strong> of the country, and contain most of the country’s high-altitude <strong>mountain roads</strong> with coverage.</p>",
      "images": [
